      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 194,
      "start": 387.58,
      "end": 388.48,
      "text": "去年有一个收腰板",
      "members": [
        194
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 75.26,
      "end": 79.04,
      "text": "它也是一款奥毛的材质非常美的那种丝毛质感",
      "members": [
        34,
        35
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 120.35,
      "end": 121.43,
      "text": "这是我们的定制面料",
      "members": [
        60
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 112.35,
      "end": 115.29,
      "text": "它就是黑这种奢侈品在卖的黑这叫脏青黑色",
      "members": [
        56
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 162,
      "start": 312.72,
      "end": 316.84,
      "text": "你们一定要明白纯黑色在整个欧洲体系里面就代表着",
      "members": [
        162
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 163,
      "start": 318.13,
      "end": 323.39,
      "text": "一个字你们懂的只有在那个场景下才穿纯黑色所以对他这个叫灰黑",
      "members": [
        163
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 170,
      "start": 339.75,
      "end": 341.93,
      "text": "就泛有灰色光芒的黑",
      "members": [
        170
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 166,
      "start": 332.79,
      "end": 335.05,
      "text": "所以他这种黑就显出来他特别高级的感觉",
      "members": [
        166
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 136.35,
      "end": 142.11,
      "text": "整个肩膀位置全部是手工修缘肩的看到了吗整个肩膀肩膀位没有高低肩",
      "members": [
